dict_en_v17 runtime dictionary (Boggle)

This file is the runtime dictionary used by the Boggle variant. It replaced
boggle-uk-game.txt, which is retained only for reference.

Source: https://tomsgreatsite.co.uk/wordsquare/dict_en_v17.txt
Format: one lowercase word per line. 151,801 entries.

The game filters this file at load time (see loadDictionary in js/boggle.js):
- entries are trimmed and upper-cased
- UK spellings are normalised (COLOR -> COLOUR, ORGANIZE -> ORGANISE, ...)
- only 4-25 letter A-Z entries are playable
- proper nouns and offensive entries in the denylists are rejected
- duplicates are removed

The filename carries the version. loadDictionary fetches with cache:
'force-cache', so replacing this file in place would leave returning players
with a stale copy. To upgrade, ship a new filename (for example
dict_en_v18.txt) and update the fetch in js/boggle.js together with the
dictionary reference in the boggle.php help modal.
